<body>
    <h1>MPSYS Modernization</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
div.rbtoc1786801817080 {padding: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1786801817080 ul {margin-left: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1786801817080 li {margin-left: 0px;padding-left: 0px;}

/*]]>*/</style></p>
<div class=3D"toc-macro rbtoc1786801817080">
<ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-Introduction">Introduction</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-WhymodernizeMPSYS?">Why modernize MPSYS?=
</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-Goals">Goals</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-MPSYSsubcomponentsandfutureplan">MPSYS s=
ub components and future plan</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-MPSYScurrentstate(PresentModeofOperation=
-PMO)">MPSYS current state (Present Mode of Operation - PMO)</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-MPSYStargetstate(FutureModeofOperation-F=
MO)">MPSYS target state (Future Mode of Operation - FMO)</a></li>
<li><a href=3D"#MPSYSModernization-Executionphases">Execution phases</a></l=
i>
</ul>
</div>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-Introduction">Introduction</h1>
<p><span style=3D"color: rgb(33,37,41);">Member Profile System (MPSYS) suit=
e of applications is the system of record for consumer's identity managemen=
t and notification preferences like Bill ready, Bill threshold etc. Access =
ids (login ids)/Member ids are created and linked to billing accounts in MP=
SYS.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"color: rgb(33,37,41);">High level functions of MPSYS:</sp=
an></p>
<ul>
<li>User/Member ID Registration</li>
<li>Forgot ID / PWD</li>
<li>User ID/Member ID/Password management</li>
<li>Lifecycle management of accounts/products/services linked to an User ID=
</li>
<li>Contact method (CBR for DSL, U-verse suite) and notification preference=
s management</li>
<li>User ID and Product level CPNI Notifications</li>
<li>Account and User Level Fraud Lock</li>
<li>Data translation and Replication to numerous clients</li>
<li>Integration with BB/DSL provisioning Applications</li>
<li>Manage Order tables for WLL and DSL</li>
<li>Product Support Tools</li>
<li>Sub account Mgmt for Member IDs</li>
<li>OTP functionality</li>
</ul>
<p><span style=3D"color: rgb(33,37,41);">This wiki page outlines why MPSYS =
needs to be modernized and current and target state of MPSYS.</span></p>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-WhymodernizeMPSYS?">Why modernize MPSYS?</h1>
<ul>
<li>Currently MPSYS uses multiple platforms in production. CDP platform for=
 deploying microservices and Wildfly servers for SOAP APIs.</li>
<li>Target IDP platform - will simplify deployment, maintenance, monitoring=
 and support.</li>
<li>CDP platform support takes longer time to take action due to ticket bas=
ed support system. This causes longer MTTR incase of outages.</li>
<li>Currently MPSYS has application downtime due to database maintenance ac=
tivities.</li>
<li>No tools available for developers to view MPSYS SOAP API metrics.</li>
<li>Maintenance cost associated with technology supplier vendors (315K/year=
 to Amdocs for deployment/monitoring/support).</li>
<li>Infrastructure costs for on-prem VMs (47K/year).</li>
<li>Licensing costs associated with various software components used (LDAP =
- <span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">$318K/year)</span>.</li>
<li>Tight coupling with client applications where clients directly lookup d=
ata from MPS-LDAP.</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-Goals">Goals</h1>
<p>These are goals that need to be met with MPSYS modernization efforts:</p=
>
<ul>
<li>Application runs on IDP platform in cloud .</li>
<li>Functionalities moved to target state applications as per target state =
architecture.</li>
<li>No application downtime due to maintenance activities.</li>
<li>Eliminate software licensing costs (LDAP, IBM MQ).</li>
<li>Cloud native technologies usage for database and event streaming.</li>
<li>Use target state application APIs (CustomerGraph, Halo, IDM etc) instea=
d of CSI.</li>
<li>Meet target SLAs for API latencies.</li>
<li>Loose coupling with other applications using APIs/event streaming.</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-MPSYSsubcomponentsandfutureplan">MPSYS sub com=
ponents and future plan</h1>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col>
<col>
<col>
<col>
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Sub component</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Functions</th>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Future plan</th>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Target application</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Member Profile System (MPSYS)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li>Manages user profile data such as password, proofing credentials, demog=
raphic information, account and service associations, contact information, =
TOS acceptance, 3rd Party Billing relationships and information on the prod=
ucts &amp; services.</li>
<li>The Member Profile Database is the authoritative namespace for allocati=
on of new user identities (Access ID &amp; Member IDs).</li>
</ol></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Modernize</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>IdentityGraph</p><p>Functions w=
ill be moved to IdentityGraph as per below:</p><p><a href=3D"/display/DRC/F=
unctional+Categories+and+Target+Platform">Functional Categories and Target =
Platform</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">MPS Subscription Services (MPS-SS)=
</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li>Provisioning flow from LS-OMS (via BBNMS and SDP) initiates Access ID a=
uto-registration and Uverse Member ID service provisioning flow</li>
<li>Uverse Subscribers, Components, Users and the Associations between them=
.</li>
<li>Uverse components have been provisioned for a subscriber. Components in=
clude HSIA, VOIP and IPTV and also Mailbox, VoIPLine, VoIP Device, STB, Gen=
re, WiFi and RG.</li>
<li>Manages settings that have been established for a user and what compone=
nts they control and the degree of control they have been given.</li>
<li>Manages basic information for unified mobility, Directv, Fixed Wireless=
 Internet (WLL).</li>
<li>Supports OTT Voice provisioning and auto-registration.</li>
</ol></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Retire</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>As Broadband services move to B=
SSe stack MPSSS can be retired.</p><p>Other products DSL and WLL need to be=
 retired.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">MPS-LDAP</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>MPS LDAP is a repository for id=
entities related to Uverse, ISP accounts.</p>
<ul>
<li>Uverse customers info is the highest data retrieval from MPS-LDAP, whic=
h includes the types of services/components that customer has registered wi=
th BAN, the registered Id details and the individual component attribute de=
tails. Highest data retrieval clients are UNS, RTTP, MRA, ISAAC.</li>
</ul></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Retire</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">&nbsp;CustomerGraph /Architecture =
proposed MPSSS APIs.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><br></p><p>DBUS- Distribution B=
US</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li>IBM MQ based event streaming platform to sync data between MPSYS and ot=
her systems.</li>
<li>Userse member id information is first created in Oracle database and as=
ync events are published to MQ queues.</li>
<li>DBUS is responsible for processing these events and update external app=
lications like Yahoo, Ericsson etc.</li>
</ol></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Modenize</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">IdentityGraph</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Product Support Tools (PST)</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Product Support Tool consisting=
 of various functions used for viewing, comparing and synching data across =
various systems. Support functions include</p>
<ul>
<li>UST - Universal Sync Tool - aka MPS Sync tool</li>
<li>AST - Account Status Tool - aka SART - Sub Account Reactivation Tool</l=
i>
<li>CST - Change Status Tool for 13 state Dial/DSL parent accounts</li>
<li>QLT - Queue Lookup Tool for MPS and MPSSS queues</li>
<li>RST - Remove Service Tool for 13 state DSL parent accounts</li>
<li>ORC =E2=80=93 Onetime Registration Code creation tool for Wireline acco=
unts</li>
<li>WLT - WTN Lookup Tool for WTN availability for provisioning and setting=
s for already provisioned WTNs</li>
</ul></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Modernize</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><br></p><p>Admin console will b=
e built for IdentityGraph similar to CustomerGraph admin console.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-MPSYScurrentstate(PresentModeofOperation-PMO)"=
>MPSYS current state (Present Mode of Operation - PMO)</h1>
<p>Current state of MPSYS is documented here:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href=3D"https://wiki.web.att.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D2027=
619175" rel=3D"nofollow">MPSYS current state</a></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-MPSYStargetstate(FutureModeofOperation-FMO)">M=
PSYS target state (Future Mode of Operation - FMO)</h1>
<p>MPSYS target state details are documented here:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href=3D"/display/DRC/MPSYS+target+state">MPSYS target state</a></li>
</ul>
<p>In target state following functions are supported in IDP-IdentityGraph:&=
nbsp;<a href=3D"/display/DRC/Functional+Categories+and+Target+Platform">Fun=
ctional Categories and Target Platform</a></p>
<h1 id=3D"MPSYSModernization-Executionphases">Execution phases</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col>
<col>
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Phases</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Capabilities&nbsp;</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan=3D"5" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><a href=3D"/display/DRC/Phase+1=
a+%28PI17-19%29+Deliverables">Phase 1a (PI17-19)</a></p><p><a href=3D"/disp=
lay/DRC/Phase+1b+%28PI20-24%29+Deliverables">Phase 1b (PI20-24)&nbsp;</a></=
p><br><p><br></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Merge MPSYS Subscription Services database to MP=
SYS database</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Buildout of Identity Graph Services:</p><p>CD=
P mS migration -</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Build CG services for LDAP retirement</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">As part of National Retail OTP project: onboard =
them to IDG CIR and implement Kafka processing for courtesy notification de=
livery (funded by that project)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Migrate cr=
edential validation functionality from Oracle to Cosmos DB</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan=3D"5" class=3D"confluenceTd"><a href=3D"/display/DRC/Phase+2+%2=
8PI25-PI27%29+Deliverables">Phase 2 (PI25-PI27)</a></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Client Onboarding to IDG services&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Onboard MPS-LDAP clients to CG</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Continue building IDG services</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Migrate On=
e Time PIN (OTP) functionality from Oracle to Cosmos DB</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(23,43,77);">Migrate IB=
M MQ and Async message processing to AEH and azure consumer mS event proces=
sing&nbsp;</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><a href=3D"/display/DRC/Phase+2+%2=
8PI25-PI27%29+Deliverables">Phase 3 (PI25-PI27)</a></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Onboard MPS-LDAP clients to CG (cont)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Retire MPS-LDAP</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Continue onboarding clients to IDG services</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">Phase 4</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Continue retirement IBM MQ async msg processing =
in favor of&nbsp;Event Hub</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Start DB cloud migration</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
